{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1483164-lore-question-lands-of-eternal-night-are-there-any-accessible-by-players","id":1483164,"title":"Lore question: Lands of Eternal Night... Are there any accessible by players?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-05T12:43:36-07:00","id":1483164,"title":"Lore question: Lands of Eternal Night... Are there any accessible by players?","content":"Are there places you can go where the sun never rises in V20?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-05T16:22:19-07:00","id":1483183,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1483164-lore-question-lands-of-eternal-night-are-there-any-accessible-by-players#post1483164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are there places you can go where the sun never rises in V20?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Honestly, i'm very tempted to ask &quot;any closed windowless space?&quot; but something tells me that you had a quite different subject in mind.<br /> <br /> Care to further explain your question a bit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-05T16:41:39-07:00","id":1483186,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1483164-lore-question-lands-of-eternal-night-are-there-any-accessible-by-players?p=1483183#post1483183\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Honestly, i'm very tempted to ask &quot;any closed windowless space?&quot; but something tells me that you had a quite different subject in mind.<br /> <br /> Care to further explain your question a bit?</div> </div> </div> </div>The game lines that immediately followed Vampire - Werewolf and Mage - gave us a vast universe called &quot;The Umbra&quot;, which could be visited, explored and settled. I know that there is a thing about Vampires not being able to safely go there, but I wondered if there are exceptions. Additionally, there is Space. <br /> <br /> The thing is, what happens on Earth influences what happens in connected parts of the Umbra. One shapes the other. In the Vampire setting, they wield enormous influence over mortal society. There should be a place in the Umbra that reflects Vampires' dark nature, a place where they can just be what they are without fear of going outside.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-05T20:37:11-07:00","id":1483203,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1483164-lore-question-lands-of-eternal-night-are-there-any-accessible-by-players#post1483164\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are there places you can go where the sun never rises in V20?</div> </div> </div> </div>With high enough Necromancy you can go to the Underworld. There's no sunlight there. Of course, there's no living people there to get blood from either, outside of the city of Enoch (controlled by the True Black Hand and inhabited by vampires, undead mages and their human followers) so picking up the Nagaraja discipline that lets you feed from ghosts would be pretty mandatory if you were planning to stay there for long.<br /> <br /> There's a few other places such as the Abyss, but there's not much to do there or the Umbra which you mentioned in your most recent post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-06T16:44:04-07:00","id":1483260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1483164-lore-question-lands-of-eternal-night-are-there-any-accessible-by-players?p=1483203#post1483203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With high enough Necromancy you can go to the Underworld. There's no sunlight there. Of course, there's no living people there to get blood from either, outside of the city of Enoch (controlled by the True Black Hand and inhabited by vampires, undead mages and their human followers) so picking up the Nagaraja discipline that lets you feed from ghosts would be pretty mandatory if you were planning to stay there for long.<br /> <br /> There's a few other places such as the Abyss, but there's not much to do there or the Umbra which you mentioned in your most recent post.</div> </div> </div> </div>I read the Dirty Secrets of the True Black Hand, which has the Soul Eater Virus, in one of the early editions, back when I played Sabbat. Enoch is certainly exclusive and would not be accessible to the average player. I guess that mostly answers my question, thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-06T23:08:11-07:00","id":1483286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HorizonParty2021</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1483164-lore-question-lands-of-eternal-night-are-there-any-accessible-by-players?p=1483260#post1483260\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I read the Dirty Secrets of the True Black Hand, which has the Soul Eater Virus, in one of the early editions, back when I played Sabbat. Enoch is certainly exclusive and would not be accessible to the average player. I guess that mostly answers my question, thank you.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Nagaraja, even by RAW, are not exactly wholy limited to the Black Hand in their numbers, but yeah, people with knowledge of their particular brand of Necromancy are definitely not as common as Auspex, Dementation or even Thaumaturgy users.<br /> <br /> Most canon stuff that touches on other worlds/dimensions is quite niche in Masquerade, usually soft-locked behind signature disciplines or elder powers, when not both. In fact, there's at least <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1074221-why-are-elder-powers-so-awful\">one thread</a> where people debate (and vent about) the subject.<br /> <br /> <br /> The only major caveat to this that i can think of has been the - undeveloped to the point of a footnote - idea that Astral Travel (Auspex 5) may give one a degree of access to certain spirit realms, something referenced by the original Soul Eater Virus fluff in Dirty Secrets of the Black Hand, in fact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 06-07-2022, 12:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-08T09:18:25-07:00","id":1483381,"title":"","content":"Aside from what has been said about the Underworld, there actually might be a few other places in the various Umbrae where it could be eternal night. There's the Near Realm Abyss (at least in the depths of the canyon), a few of the Spirit Courts in the Spires of the High Umbra (I suspect that there might even be an Antediluvian who has 'ascended' to godhood there), some of the Yomi Hells from Kindred of the East, and a few underground holds/regions in the Dreaming. 'Real' blood would only be found in the latter two, although I suspect there would be combination Disciplines that could work around this. Technically, the option of going into the Deep Umbra version of outer space, where the sun would be so far away it might not matter anymore. is also possible. I've been debating a grand reworking of the various Otherworlds for awhile now, so there could be other locations as well. I just have to work out a few more details.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>THWarted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17984-toby-weingarten","name":"Toby Weingarten","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-08T21:34:48-07:00","id":1483439,"title":"","content":"Considering that no description of the Umbra is exhaustive, you could have Eternal Night Realms all around the place without really disrupting the canon. There may be other vampire-friendly places in the Dark Umbra, dark cavern worlds in the Middle Umbra, even Horizon Realms where the sun never shines, or doesn't hurt vampires for whatever reason.<br /> <br /> You can also have some of those places be able to sustain vampires, from having a handful of wandering humans local vampires can hunt and hoard as treasure, to literal rivers of Vitae, depending on how easy or hard you want it to be for them.<br /> <br /> Both how to get there or where to go there for vampires is just a blank page for the setting, far more a non-explored thing than an actual barrier. Even the idea that the Umbra is dangerous for vampires is... vague to say the least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-10T17:36:26-07:00","id":1483664,"title":"","content":"In the two-thousands, I was concluding a longstanding campaign set in Montreal. My storyteller could not stand to run a game that was taking place during a different season than the one we were actually in. We always matched the seasonal timeline to this particularity. It happened to be Summer. The campaign had our characters regularly planning operations in Quebec City and travelling there. Sundown was around 8:45 PM and dawn was at 4:45 AM. Between feeding, handling the competitive ambitions of fellow Sabbat Vampires and leaving havens unguarded to make progress in Quebec, we were often at risk of getting roasted by the dawn rays for lack of time. Overall, it was an intensely fun campaign, but I was left with a yearning that's come to express itself in the form of this thread. Perhaps, all that is needed is to invent a type of Umbrood that has blood and regularly recovers Essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}